    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3509777a6145e18e2297a69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我能大致明白她的意思。\r\n前一周期，也就是上一世代的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b9b5f491ddaa3b25181a2bd53349979efc027a204128004dad310ebfeab6de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722f82dc163a2fca5ae0dade",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而这就意味着——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2449fadf6ae2594c0e77697c6d99c5002211a8fd3e08455771fb6bd6b0cdb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b0d0bba29b0ee379a44283b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77729c6a477bba265f4f36f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“入场券”已经到手了。\r\n偏置至其他轨道。\r\n接下来要参加的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6ece49ea3e41da98e99c2fb2dcc287e0097edb6578efab6fe3e403617c16af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23f932db2586ff1e4423d08a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你认真的吗？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb24b31c7b657cb79da14816e368e43d5bd71a680ec399804abc01cfc651f4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
