    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b234bbfb8ad7597a973f551b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——『宝冢纪念』",
      "source_fingerprint": "d229acfb39d3e83d8154dd4e88e8fdf297b085dd15b76d109c652a10e42f63d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5793d8cda239aed1f4fd2e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就制度而言，的确是可能的。\r\n经典级的赛马娘在六月之后，的确可以参加有\r\n古马级赛马娘参加的混合赛事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0cd843ffae9f942cede430628eb73ac20d877c22a47e3516b36a5d5005da5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f4bff5cd023de15d0875ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，她的确可以参加六月后半的GⅠ\r\n级赛事『宝冢纪念』。不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f7e3cf6b0275da5b8c59ed2115e783c1fd5875f4f2a259db8104321e25d1d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44d9c3219af08aa86407d05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
