    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9086eac19a5f4aa0a32932ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至少，现在……\r\n——至少，这场德比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2365a39f2c235513c8bbd5a88f9efdbdb03ce402fdbd4300110380e94959ec20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf28c1b74a7805e5d4e358bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的有力竞争者在经典级选择参加『宝\r\n冢纪念』，的确相当少见。要问为什么的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77bdd409054b0ca389c6be80b78c49ab218fcf04965f0a235ba4a2c466a8caf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fc8a63cb7192bbb9b998d96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这实在是太过胡来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9315a9c317ba21b37a68480da42dbbf5cd9e6b8a561443d4943dc0124747bdd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56de2008f9d17bf336923a97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这意味着，短短一个月之内连战两场GⅠ级赛事。\r\n而且参加『宝冢纪念』的大多是实力雄厚的古马\r\n级赛马娘，对经典级的她而言实在是压力过大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a356871cfa55ef2080648d41b96de2490f003aea0f33862c0eea5237f089b98b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
