    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0511955844a41996402a9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯有『连接』——才是能源。\r\n与训练员的连接，与其他赛马娘的连接……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9338d602d0fe38422ad4528255735446e3363128c33760a8069d511878b858e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
